x solid #173a63;color:#03162e;font-size:clamp(19px,4.8vw,23px);line-height:1.35;font-weight:850;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:normal\">환율과 시장 여건</h2><p style=\"margin:0\">USD/KRW 수집 시점 현재가 1,330.7</p></section>\n<section style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:26px 0 0\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:0 0 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #173a63;color:#03162e;font-size:clamp(19px,4.8vw,23px);line-height:1.35;font-weight:850;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:normal\">수급이 가리킨 방향</h2><div data-visualization=\"korea-investor-flow\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px;width:100%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><strong>개인</strong><span style=\"color:#1565c0;font-weight:800\">-11,767</span></div><div style=\"height:8px;background:#eef2f6\"><span style=\"display:block;width:46%;height:100%;background:#1565c0\"></span></div></div><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px;width:100%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><strong>외국인</strong><span style=\"color:#c62828;font-weight:800\">+947</span></div><div style=\"height:8px;background:#eef2f6\"><span style=\"display:block;width:4%;height:100%;background:#c62828\"></span></div></div><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px;width:100%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><strong>기관</strong><span style=\"color:#c62828;font-weight:800\">+5,302</span></div><div style=\"height:8px;background:#eef2f6\"><span style=\"display:block;width:21%;height:100%;background:#c62828\"></span></div></div></div></section>\n<section style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:26px 0 0\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:0 0 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #173a63;color:#03162e;font-size:clamp(19px,4.8vw,23px);line-height:1.35;font